# Variables every Flux Kustomization substitutes into its manifests (the cluster-vars ConfigMap, see kustomization.yaml).
#
# ZOT_MIRROR_*: where the OCIRepositories (oci://${ZOT_MIRROR_GHCR:=ghcr.io}/...) find their charts, through zot. The cache names are
# those of patches/11-zot-mirrors.yaml. A variable that is missing or commented out leaves the url on the upstream registry.
#
# Bootstrapping a cluster that has no zot yet (zot, Cilium and the rest come from OCIRepositories too): comment these out for the
# first sync, wait until gitops-infra-registry-system is Ready, then restore them.
ZOT_MIRROR_GHCR=zot.registry-system.svc.cluster.local:5000/ghcr-cache
ZOT_MIRROR_QUAY=zot.registry-system.svc.cluster.local:5000/quay-cache
ZOT_MIRROR_K8S=zot.registry-system.svc.cluster.local:5000/k8s-cache
